OL,3,GNEWSAVeteran recalls UK links while
OL,4,Aserving in India
OL,5,
OL,6,FA World War Two veteran, who celebrated
OL,7,Fhis 101st birthday, has reflected on
OL,8,Fhis time in the armed forces, which
OL,9,Fincluded joining thousands of troops in
OL,10,FIndia when he was 19.
OL,12,FDavid Lightfoot told the BBC the
OL,13,Fremarkable story of when he went to a
OL,14,Fcinema in India and a holiday advert
OL,15,Fappeared of Polperro, Cornwall, his
OL,16,Fhome town.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
